cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data, please cite the corresponding article and this repository (see README)."
title: "Research data package: Monetised Play and Indebted Borrowing: Online Gaming and the Rise of Online Lending (Pinjol) in Indonesia — A PRISMA 2020 Systematic Review Through the Maqāṣid al-Sharīʿah"
abstract: >-
  Extraction dataset (36 studies, S01-S36), eligibility criteria, verbatim
  database search strings, screening and exclusion log, quality appraisal, and
  GRADE-CERQual certainty appraisal for a PRISMA 2020 systematic review on
  online gaming, in-game monetisation, and online lending (pinjol) in Indonesia,
  appraised through the maqasid al-Shari'ah.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous (author identity withheld for double-anonymized peer review)"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-13"
license: CC-BY-4.0
